			"notes": "## Fixes\n- **Modded Stack-Size Threshold Bug**: Fixed depth-0 (raw material) thresholds being blown up to whatever an inflated max-stack-size mod set an item's stack size to (observed: 9,999). Thresholds are now clamped to a sane baseline.\n- **Search Bar Keybind Leak**: Typing \"E\" (or other letter keys bound to vanilla keybinds) while searching the catalog no longer closes the GUI mid-type.\n- **Deposit-All Button Overlap**: Fixed the Deposit All button overlapping other UI text in the Deposit tab.\n- **Mojibake Tooltip Text**: Removed unicode symbols from tooltip/catalog text that rendered as garbled characters on some versions.\n\n## New Features\n- **Shared Team Catalogs**: `/journeymode team create|join|leave|info|kick|transfer`. Teams pool both deposits and unlocks; scoped per-world/per-server. Leaving a team snapshots its unlocks into your personal catalog.\n- **Real-Time Config Sync**: Blacklist and threshold rules are pushed to clients on join and after `/journeymode reloadconfig`, so multiplayer clients always see the server's actual rules.\n- **Integration & Customization API**: `blacklist.json` and `custom_thresholds.json` now support exact item IDs, item tags (`#c:ingots`), and regex/wildcard patterns (`gtceu:.*_circuit`). Datapack-driven threshold packs and a developer API (`ThresholdProvider`, `NormalizationRule`) for other mods to hook into.\n- **`/journeymode all [count] confirm`**: Set a global fallback threshold for every item at once.\n- **`/journeymode threshold <item|hand> <count>`**: Fix an individual item's threshold on the fly, including a `hand` variant for exact potion/enchanted-book sub-types.\n- **`/journeymode grant|revoke <player> <item|hand>`**: Admin-grant or revoke unlocks, works on offline players too.\n- **`/journeymode tooltips on|off`**: Per-player toggle for the new progress tooltips.\n- **Rarity-Aware Thresholds**: Recipe-less rare items (Nether Stars, Heart of the Sea, Echo Shards, etc.) now cost far less than common raw materials of the same stack size.\n- **Deposit All**: One button deposits every already-researchable item in your main inventory (shift-click to include your hotbar too).\n- **Progress Tooltips**: See \"37/64 researched\" or \"Unlocked\" directly on item tooltips.\n- **Catalog Statistics**: New Stats tab - total unlocked/researchable, % complete, per-mod breakdown, most-recent unlock.\n- **Visual Polish**: An on-screen message when you cross an unlock threshold.\n\nApplied universally across all 9 supported loader/version configurations (Forge 1.12.2/1.16.5/1.19.2/1.20.1, Fabric 1.16.5/1.19.2/1.20.1/1.21.1, NeoForge 1.21.1)."
		},
