			"notes": "#1.7.1\n\n### Changelog\n- **Fixed Subtype Retrieval Bug**: Fixed an issue where depositing potions, enchanted books, and other items with sub-properties (e.g., goat horns, suspicious stews) rendered them as \"Uncraftable Potions\" or caused them to lose their visual effects and NBT tags when retrieved from the Journey Mode tab.\n- **Subtype-Aware Serialization**: Implemented hybrid serialization to distinguish between potion types, enchantments, and metadata-based subtypes while keeping tools, weapons, and armor unlocking at the base item level.\n- **Universal Fix**: Applied across all 9 target versions and loaders (Forge/NeoForge/Fabric for 1.12.2, 1.16.5, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.21.1)."
		},
